{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/308075-botches-in-your-game","id":308075,"title":"Botches in your game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-10T05:15:40-08:00","id":308075,"title":"Botches in your game","content":"I used a recently a botch in an entertaining way. I ran V20 session, players got their hands on a mysterious plant they found during investigation, and asked semi-NPC with Green Path to check on the plant. Willpower roll went too good, so to not make it easy I demanded Intelligent+Occult roll to interpret visions gleaned. And... a one big mofo of a botch happened. Being cruel and feeling inspired by my Pathfinder GM who had my PC nearly drown in magic slime and temporarily lose half Constitution, I decided that the visions overwhelmed the Tremere and he fell into one month torpor basing on his Humanity score.<br /> <br /> Everyone joke it must have been some good shit. And the reveal is saved from leaking too early.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T06:03:08-08:00","id":308146,"title":"","content":"Rite of Summoning; The Pack were heading into what was expected to be a big ruck with a Wyrm Infested location and had a few days to prepare, so they set to making Talens and Learning some Gifts. I forget what they were doing this summoning for, but they wanted a Spirit of Rage or War ( a big one) for some aid in the upcoming fray. The pack is gathered on the roof of the Urban Caern's building and perform the Rite... and Botches, big. The Heavens of the Umbra literally split and Nerigal appears before the pack! An incarna is well above their ability to try and deal with, especially a pissed off Celestine of Battle and War. The Ahroun tries to dive between the Theurge and the Mars Incarna and gets his guts ripped out on the barbed spear thrust by Nerigal. The Philodox and Ragabash are tossed aside like leaves caught in a storm, by which point the Theurge has recovered enough from the shock to try and treat with the War God. He manages to speak with the angered Spirit to get it to keep from slaughtering the pack and Nerigal agrees to the bargain, with one more cost. The Celestine of Mars reaches out with his mighty hands and rips the Theurge's arm from his body (Battlescar) with a ban against healing. Thus he earned the named &quot;Wounded by Mars&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T06:10:43-08:00","id":308149,"title":"","content":"Well, a month of torpor might be nothing in some games and very harsh in others. Depends extremely on the playstyle so can't really evaluate that.<br /> <br /> However I had a Character using Auspex3 somewhere on a Graveyard to investigate. The character botched really hard (I do measure the severeness of botches by the number of 1s rolled) and I decided that in the same spot she used her discipline a summoning of a dark entity took place some time ago. The botch lead to her forming a connection to the energies of this ritual and the essence of a dark being started to flow into her.<br /> <br /> The Player reacted quickly as she felt weird and saw her arm beginning to transform into something monstrous that she couldn't control. She had another player cut off that arm instantly and killed it with fire <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> .<br /> To bad those damn Tremere tend to have high willpower other characters might have hesitated longer for even more fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1235-eadee","name":"Eadee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T06:39:30-08:00","id":308162,"title":"","content":"Losing arms in two first posts. Hmmmm....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T06:42:37-08:00","id":308164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eadee</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/308075-botches-in-your-game?p=308149#post308149\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... (I do measure the severeness of botches by the number of 1s rolled) ...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yay, me too! <br /> <br /> This was a Sorcerer's Crusade game (medium-high fantasy). There was an Akashic, Verbena, and a Seer. The Seer was a 'dancer', and used a healthy dose of seduction and Mind magick to solve her problems.<br /> <br /> Except when at the outset of a very important encounter, she tried to perform a seductive dance to get a handle on the situation before it began. After a triple botch (on 3 dice) what she instead performed was Elaine's Dance.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://gifsoup.com/view/1150133/elaine-seinfeld-dance.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gifsoup.com/view/1150133/elaine-seinfeld-dance.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://gifsoup.com/view/1150133/elaine-seinfeld-dance.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://gifsoup.com/view/1150133/elaine-seinfeld-dance.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","name":"SixFootChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"559"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T06:42:57-08:00","id":308165,"title":"","content":"Aww hell... we're turning into StarWars Lightsaber fight results.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T06:53:37-08:00","id":308167,"title":"","content":"Another one and this was born from pure RAW which in this case made me giggle. <br /> Memebrs of the Pack were stepping sideways so one of the Ragabash decides to use the reflection in the Ahroun's Klaive as the reflective surface to aid in cross the Gauntlet. Seems reasonable. Every dice on the Gnosis roll came up 1 or 2, the guy's face went white at the concept of being caught in the webs so deep in the City. It went even whiter when (as per the RAW) the Klaive cracked instead... Game them a whole new quest and some lovely angsty RP between the Ahroun and the Ragabash.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T06:55:39-08:00","id":308169,"title":"","content":"That said, I should implement critical hit chart from Dark Heresy:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://1d4chan.org/images/2/2a/DH_CH_rending_arm.JPG\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d R